      "Logged and tracked 15+ RFIs and submittals in Procore under project engineer supervision, contributing to reduced document turnaround time.",
      "Produced daily meeting minutes for contractor, safety, and staff meetings, aligning 25+ stakeholders on action items and deadlines.",
